---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/piles-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/piles-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="812 applications, three piles"
  caption="One mark per application. The first pass sets the order I read in. It removes no one."
>
  Unit chart with one mark for each of 812 sorted applications. 124 are in the research pile, meaning a deeper look before any call. 660 are in maybe, sorted with the strongest first. 28 are in likely pass, which a person still decides.
</Chart>
